			"Message": "chore(Mountain): Reformat source files and rename product identifier to fcd\n\nApply code-style improvements across several Mountain subsystems — consolidate multi-line imports into single lines, add consistent blank-line separators in match arms, reflow doc comments to 100-char wrapping, and tighten brace placement around expression blocks. These are purely stylistic; no logic changes.\n\nRename the Tauri URI scheme protocol and PostHog event $app property from \"fiddee\" to \"fcd\", adopting the shorter product identifier. Touches Entry.rs (.register_asynchronous_uri_scheme_protocol) and CaptureEvent.rs (Event.insert_prop(\"$app\", ...)).\n\nAffected files: KeybindingState, GetUserKeybindings, RegisterExtensionKeybindings, CheckKeybindingConflicts, Bootstrap, Keybinding, SourceControlManagement, AirStart, CaptureEvent, Entry.",
			"SHA": "f0610eefff4962308fab5c4fdb3e7db72bd713d4"
		},
